  bad "G221 the map's edge ring is shroud that nothing lifts: corner=[$G221CORNER](want HIDDEN) inner=[$G221INNER](want CLEAR) black on=$G221ON off=$G221OFF (want a fall >= 100000) GRC=$GRC"
